# Marketing surface — Workers Static Assets routing (live acgs.ai).
#
# acgs.ai is served by the Worker `acgs-governance-proxy` (Workers Static
# Assets), NOT the Pages project — Worker routes on acgs.ai/* run before Pages.
# This file is the Workers-compatible sibling of ../_redirects (Pages parity):
# Workers Assets rejects 404-status rules and the `/* /index.html 200`
# catch-all (infinite-loop detector, error 100324), and normalizes
# `/index.html` rewrite targets into 307s that strip the deep-link path.
# Hence: explicit per-route rewrites, target `/`, status 200.
#
# Verified live 2026-07-10: deep links 200 with URL preserved, /console 308,
# missing assets still 404 empty-body (deploy-drift-check asserts this).
#
# Keep in lockstep with the marketing route table in
# src/surfaces/marketing/App.tsx. Unknown paths intentionally 404 at the edge
# (no SPA catch-all): scanners and agent discovery need real 404s.

# Canonical www→apex 301 lives in worker.js — Workers Assets _redirects
# rejects absolute-URL sources (error 100324), unlike Pages.

# Privilege boundary — /console is a SEPARATE, privileged origin (DEPLOY.md §3).
/console        https://console.acgs.ai/console          308
/console/*      https://console.acgs.ai/console/:splat    308

